.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/deployments","created_at":"2012-07-25T13:01:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T02:15:19Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T19:20:30Z","git_url":"git://github.com/redis/go-redis.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:redis/go-redis.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis","homepage":"https://redis.io","size":28194,"stargazers_count":21734,"watchers_count":21734,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":2525,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":61,"license":{"key":"bsd-2-clause","name":"BSD 2-Clause \"Simplified\" License","spdx_id":"BSD-2-Clause","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/bsd-2-clause","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTQ="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["go","golang","redis","redis-client","redis-cluster"],"visibility":"public","forks":2525,"open_issues":61,"watchers":21734,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/pulls/2814","html_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis/pull/2814","diff_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis/pull/2814.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis/pull/2814.patch","merged_at":"2023-12-10T10:04:14Z"},"body":"#2730 \r\n\r\n### Overview\r\nThis PR addresses a critical data race issue discovered in `hooksMixin` when `MinIdleConns` is set to a value greater than 1, and `client.AddHook` is used concurrently.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nThe data race was identified during test, specifically in scenarios where `MinIdleConns` triggers the creation of idle connections in a separate goroutine, while `client.AddHook` modifies the hooks concurrently. This concurrent access and modification of `hooks.dialer` led to a data race.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nTo resolve this concurrency issue, the following modifications were made:\r\n\r\nIntroduced a `sync.Mutex` in the `hooksMixin` struct to ensure thread-safe operations.\r\nImplemented locking and unlocking around critical sections in `AddHook` and `dialHook` methods to prevent concurrent read/write conflicts.\r\nAdjusted the clone method in `hooksMixin` to handle the mutex correctly, avoiding the copying of mutex state.\r\n\r\nI invite feedback and further review on these changes!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/issues/2814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/issues/2814/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/issues/comments/1831850691","html_url":"https://github.com/redis/go-redis/issues/2730#issuecomment-1831850691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redis/go-redis/issues/2730","id":1831850691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAE8G285tL9LD","user":{"login":"RyoMiyashita","id":25573492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NTczNDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25573492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyashita","html_url":"https://github.com/RyoMiyashita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyashita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyashita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyashita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyashita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyoMiyash